[2026-03-08T17:14:15.187Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   error reporting, and routes runtime messages through an explicit handler map rather than one long if
[2026-03-08T17:14:15.187Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   ladder. popup.js was tightened to use the same shared schema, apply data-i18n-aria-label, drop the old
