[2026-03-08T17:44:48.844Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node]     screenshot. The relevant collision is between the persistent viewer glass shell in styles.css:2294 and the
[2026-03-08T17:44:48.844Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node]     intended open-state reset in styles.css:2310, with the parent card still tagged open by content.js:1154 and
