[2026-03-08T17:44:52.436Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T17:44:52.436Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node]   - High: the right-side “glass sidebar” treatment is wider than the real sidebar and creates an artificial dark
[2026-03-08T17:44:52.436Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node]     gutter. The overlay pseudo-layer in styles.css:2340 and the matching top cap in styles.css:2360 hard-code
[2026-03-08T17:44:52.436Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node]     min(344px, 24vw), but the live Sources/Activity panel was only about 266px wide. That overshoot is why the
