[2026-03-08T17:44:59.408Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T17:44:59.408Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node]   - Medium: the surface-tagging model is a little too clever and is probably what’s making these bugs sticky. The
[2026-03-08T17:44:59.408Z] [out] [id=1] [terminal=node]     same open report remains a research-viewer while also containing a separately tagged research-overlay via
